-12-09T06:28:53Z","body":"@Geometror PR ready for review","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527050852/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544776769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100048#issuecomment-2544776769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100048","id":2544776769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XrjZB","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T07:14:06Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T09:11:30Z","body":"> I am actually not sure whether we should add this method. IMO it makes more sense to expose a general `get_adjacent_connections_list(p_node)` with which you can efficiently get the connections from/to a given node [using the unexposed `connection_map`] and then filter for the specific port by yourself. Performance isn't a problem this way since you don't iterate over all connections in GDScript.\r\n\r\n@Geometror  Do you mean a method that would get a list of all ports and connections for a given node?\r\n\r\nIf so, it might be more efficient if we need to manipulate multiple ports instead of just one, and check their connections, which is what happens most often.\r\n\r\nBut it's not efficient if we only need to check one port and its connections.\r\n\r\nIf it makes sense, I can rewrite the function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2544776769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545061960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100048#issuecomment-2545061960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100048","id":2545061960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XspBI","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T09:34:25Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T09:34:25Z","body":"What I am proposing is a function that uses the internal `connection_map` to provide access to all input/output connections for any given node in constant time. \r\nWith this function, you could then implement `get_connection_list_from_port` purely in GDScript and the performance impact would be minimal since you'd only need to iterate over the small subset of connections associated with a specific node, rather than the entire graph. This approach maintains constant time complexity with respect to the total number of connections in the graph.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545061960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585135850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100048#issuecomment-2585135850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100048","id":2585135850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aFgrq","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","recei